  <section class="download-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="zh-only">下载 webcool</h1>
      <h1 class="en-only">Download webcool</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle zh-only">文酷 · 私有文件管理平台</p>
      <p class="hero-subtitle en-only">Wencool · Private File Management</p>
      <p class="hero-desc zh-only">
        选择对应平台的安装包或应用。服务端支持 macOS、Linux 与 Windows，
        安装包自包含 webcool、sqlite 与 ffmpeg；移动端连接你的 webcool 服务器。
      </p>
      <p class="hero-desc en-only">
        Choose the installer or app for your platform. Server packages for macOS, Linux, and Windows
        bundle webcool, sqlite, and ffmpeg. Mobile apps connect to your webcool server.
      </p>
      <div class="version-badge">
        <span class="zh-only">当前版本</span>
        <span class="en-only">Latest</span>
