  <!-- Server downloads -->
  <section id="server" class="download-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="download-section-title zh-only">服务端安装包</h2>
      <h2 class="download-section-title en-only">Server Installers</h2>
      <p class="download-section-desc zh-only">
        适用于家庭服务器、工作站或私有云部署。安装后运行 <code>webcool -s 0.0.0.0:8080</code> 即可在浏览器访问控制台。
      </p>
      <p class="download-section-desc en-only">
        For home servers, workstations, or private cloud. After install, run <code>webcool -s 0.0.0.0:8080</code> and open the console in your browser.
      </p>
      <div class="download-grid">
        <article class="download-card">
          <div class="download-card-icon">🍎</div>
          <h3>macOS</h3>
          <p class="platform-meta">.pkg · Apple Silicon &amp; Intel</p>
          <p class="platform-desc zh-only">双击安装包完成安装，程序部署于 <code>/opt/webcool</code>，启动入口为 <code>/usr/local/bin/webcool</code>。</p>
          <p class="platform-desc en-only">Double-click the .pkg to install under <code>/opt/webcool</code>; launcher at <code>/usr/local/bin/webcool</code>.</p>
          <div class="download-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" data-download-key="macos_arm64">
              <span class="zh-only">下载 Apple Silicon</span>
              <span class="en-only">Apple Silicon</span>
            </a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" data-download-key="macos_x64">
              <span class="zh-only">下载 Intel</span>
              <span class="en-only">Intel (x86_64)</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="download-card">
          <div class="download-card-icon">🐧</div>
          <h3>Debian / Ubuntu</h3>
          <p class="platform-meta">.deb · amd64 &amp; arm64</p>
          <p class="platform-desc zh-only">适用于 Debian、Ubuntu 及衍生发行版。安装后同样部署于 <code>/opt/webcool</code>。</p>
          <p class="platform-desc en-only">For Debian, Ubuntu, and derivatives. Installs to <code>/opt/webcool</code>.</p>
          <div class="download-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" data-download-key="deb_amd64">
              <span class="zh-only">下载 amd64</span>
              <span class="en-only">amd64</span>
            </a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" data-download-key="deb_arm64">
              <span class="zh-only">下载 arm64</span>
              <span class="en-only">arm64</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="download-card">
          <div class="download-card-icon">🔴</div>
          <h3>CentOS / RHEL</h3>
          <p class="platform-meta">.rpm · x86_64 &amp; aarch64</p>
          <p class="platform-desc zh-only">适用于 CentOS、RHEL、Rocky Linux、AlmaLinux 等 RPM 系发行版。</p>
          <p class="platform-desc en-only">For CentOS, RHEL, Rocky Linux, AlmaLinux, and other RPM-based distros.</p>
          <div class="download-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" data-download-key="rpm_x86_64">
              <span class="zh-only">下载 x86_64</span>
              <span class="en-only">x86_64</span>
            </a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" data-download-key="rpm_aarch64">
              <span class="zh-only">下载 aarch64</span>
              <span class="en-only">aarch64</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="download-card">
          <div class="download-card-icon">🪟</div>
          <h3>Windows</h3>
          <p class="platform-meta">.exe / .zip · x64</p>
          <p class="platform-desc zh-only">
            推荐使用安装向导（setup.exe），默认安装至 <code>C:\Program Files\webcool</code>，
            并创建开始菜单与桌面快捷方式。上传数据位于 <code>C:\ProgramData\webcool\uploads</code>。
            <!--也可下载 ZIP 解压后运行 <code>run-webcool.ps1</code>。-->
          </p>
          <p class="platform-desc en-only">
            Prefer the setup.exe installer (defaults to <code>C:\Program Files\webcool</code>,
            Start Menu &amp; desktop shortcuts). Uploads go to <code>C:\ProgramData\webcool\uploads</code>.
            <!--Or download the ZIP and run <code>run-webcool.ps1</code>.-->
          </p>
          <div class="download-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" data-download-key="windows_setup">
              <span class="zh-only">下载安装程序</span>
              <span class="en-only">Setup EXE</span>
            </a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" data-download-key="windows_zip">
              <span class="zh-only">下载 ZIP 包</span>
              <span class="en-only">ZIP Package</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mobile downloads -->
  <section id="mobile" class="download-section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="download-section-title zh-only">移动端应用</h2>
      <h2 class="download-section-title en-only">Mobile Apps</h2>
      <p class="download-section-desc zh-only">
        安装移动端后，在登录页填写 webcool 服务器地址，或使用局域网扫描自动发现。
      </p>
      <p class="download-section-desc en-only">
        After installing, enter your webcool server URL on login, or use LAN scan to auto-discover.
      </p>
      <div class="download-grid">
        <article class="download-card">
          <div class="download-card-icon">🤖</div>
          <h3>Android</h3>
          <p class="platform-meta">.apk · Android 6.0+</p>
          <p class="platform-desc zh-only">
            下载 APK 后安装。若系统提示未知来源，请在设置中允许安装来自此来源的应用。
            支持相册增量备份、虚拟磁盘浏览、标签管理与视频投屏。
          </p>
          <p class="platform-desc en-only">
            Download and install the APK. Allow installs from this source if prompted.
            Album backup, virtual disk browse, tags, and video casting included.
          </p>
          <div class="download-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" data-download-key="android">
              <span class="zh-only">下载 Android APK</span>
              <span class="en-only">Download APK</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="download-card ios-card">
          <div class="download-card-icon">📱</div>
          <h3>iOS</h3>
          <p class="platform-meta">App Store · iPhone / iPad</p>
          <p class="platform-desc zh-only">
            iOS 版请前往 Apple App Store 下载，不支持在此页面直接安装 -- 敬请期待!
          </p>
          <p class="platform-desc en-only">
            The iOS app is available on the Apple App Store — not as a direct download here.
          </p>
          <div class="appstore-guide">
            <strong class="zh-only">在 App Store 中搜索</strong>
            <strong class="en-only">Search on the App Store</strong>
            <div class="appstore-keywords">
              <span>webcool</span>
              <span class="zh-only">文酷</span>
              <span class="en-only">Wencool</span>
            </div>
            <ol class="appstore-steps zh-only">
              <li>打开 iPhone 或 iPad 上的 <strong>App Store</strong></li>
              <li>点击底部搜索，输入 <strong>webcool</strong> 或 <strong>文酷</strong></li>
              <li>找到 webcool 应用后点击「获取」安装</li>
              <li>打开应用，填写 webcool 服务器地址或扫描局域网</li>
            </ol>
            <ol class="appstore-steps en-only">
              <li>Open the <strong>App Store</strong> on your iPhone or iPad</li>
              <li>Tap Search and enter <strong>webcool</strong> or <strong>文酷</strong></li>
              <li>Find the webcool app and tap Get to install</li>
              <li>Launch the app, enter your server URL or use LAN scan</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
<!--
          <div class="download-actions" style="margin-top: 16px;">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://apps.apple.com/cn/search?term=webcool" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <span class="zh-only">前往 App Store 搜索</span>
              <span class="en-only">Open App Store Search</span>
            </a>
          </div>
-->

        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
